flowchart TD
  A[Patient selects service and arrival window] --> B{Window has capacity?}
  B -- No --> C[Show alternatives or waitlist route]
  B -- Yes --> D[AppointmentBooked / Confirmed]
  D --> E{Patient cancels before attendance?}
  E -- Yes --> F[AppointmentCancelled; record event]
  E -- No --> G[Patient arrives at clinic]
  G --> H[Check-in requested by kiosk or staff]
  H --> I{Rule decision}
  I -- Within window --> J[CheckInAccepted]
  I -- Too early --> K[Explain policy / assisted route]
  I -- Late --> L[LateArrivalReview]
  I -- Grace elapsed --> M[No-show eligible; staff/policy resolution]
  J --> N[QueueTicketIssued]
  N --> O[PatientCalled]
  O --> P[ConsultationStarted]
  P --> Q[ConsultationCompleted]
  F --> R[Audit trail updated]
  K --> R
  L --> R
  M --> R
  J --> R
  N --> R
  O --> R
  P --> R
  Q --> R
